{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreadwoods Gatekeeper</i> will have 4\u20135 hours of gameplay, featuring a gatekeeping job simulator, a mystery-thriller story with many characters and layers, and a touch of bow combat that you\u2019ll master alongside the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/d0763791da75b8c0824399fd2a440eeb.poster.avif?t=1772030765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/d0763791da75b8c0824399fd2a440eeb.webm?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/d0763791da75b8c0824399fd2a440eeb.mp4?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You arrive in the small town of Dreadwoods to take on the job of gatekeeper. The previous guard was killed, the townsfolk cling to strange superstitions, barricading their homes at the sound of the Minster bell, and new rumors of a monster lurking in the woods are spreading.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Managing the gatehouse:</strong> Talk with townsfolk, open the gate, inspect trading wagons and their documents, grant or deny entry, and handle maintenance duties.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/7827fae0beb24ad9ba0d28d61233b82a.poster.avif?t=1772030765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/7827fae0beb24ad9ba0d28d61233b82a.webm?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/7827fae0beb24ad9ba0d28d61233b82a.mp4?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story:</strong> Get familiar with the town and its inhabitants. Make friends or enemies. Dreadwoods is a small, isolated town lagging behind the rest of civilization, holding many secrets and silly superstitions.    <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/09b9105f2f4c628fe34bf1f3ba225c81.poster.avif?t=1772030765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/09b9105f2f4c628fe34bf1f3ba225c81.webm?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/09b9105f2f4c628fe34bf1f3ba225c81.mp4?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patrolling:</strong> The protagonist is no great warrior, but as he finds himself patrolling the forest perimeter, he'll have to master the bow to protect himself and others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/36f614e88d35b5dba3782634b859ebcd.poster.avif?t=1772030765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/36f614e88d35b5dba3782634b859ebcd.webm?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/36f614e88d35b5dba3782634b859ebcd.mp4?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist and Follow</strong> to be notified as soon as the earliest demo is released.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2389020?t=1772030765","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772030765","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772030765","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772030765","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"There are adult themes in the game, including sex and drugs, but no visual nudity."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Dreadwoods Gatekeeper</i> will have 4\u20135 hours of gameplay, featuring a gatekeeping job simulator, a mystery-thriller story with many characters and layers, and a touch of bow combat that you\u2019ll master alongside the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/d0763791da75b8c0824399fd2a440eeb.poster.avif?t=1772030765\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/d0763791da75b8c0824399fd2a440eeb.webm?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389020/extras/d0763791da75b8c0824399fd2a440eeb.mp4?t=1772030765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span